      "english": "Manuscript fragments, genealogical sketches, notes, and brief regesta [by Dean Hermann Bauer of Weinsberg] on the history of the nobility in the district and its relations in Baden and Bavarian Franconia\n\nDate range: [c. 1850s–1860s, before 1872]\n\nContents: Mainly the Barons von Crailsheim, the Schenks von Schüpf, the stewards von Nordenberg (including a sketch of the arms of Lupold von Weiltingen, 1298), the mayor of Rothenburg (including a sketch of the seal of Hermann Schultheiß of R.), the lords of Erkenbrechtshausen, and the von Rosenberg family; Stuttgarter Neues Tagblatt, 7 April 1864: obituary for Ottmar Schönhuth. Some reverse sides contain correspondence and student exercises.\n\nExtent: 1 file."
    }
